From 15e49303f87e42f5c8944616395c03f3f291ebb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bradent27-sketch <304192343+bradent27-sketch@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:40:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Retire v2_new_team_starter_restoration and
 v2_cold_start_regression

- v2_new_team_starter_restoration (2026-09-04): let a team-changer charted rank 1 on the new team recover his role (capped at 0.80).
  Off since its backtest queue (Waddle MIA->DEN, Evans TB->SF cases); the same-team recovery paths are unchanged.
- v2_cold_start_regression (2026-08-27): pull every cold-start matchup / script / pace / environment / weather multiplier 25% of the
  way back to 1.0. Built and gated, never shipped.
Removes the allow_new_team_starter path of restore_cold_start_returning_role_share and its constants, the six regression sites and
COLD_START_MULTIPLIER_REGRESSION, two sweep scripts and two tests (the default behavior test, a team-changer stays on his whole-season
share, is kept). Default cold-start boards identical (.sweeps/board_identity.py: 2022 w1, 2024 w1, live 2026 w1, 2025 w1 with the
Ourlads charts). Restore with git revert of this commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
